Package: pkncaWinNonlinBridge
Title: Cross-Validation of NCA Engines: PKNCA, NonCompart and Phoenix WinNonlin
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Bo", "Ma", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reproducible comparison of three non-compartmental analysis
    engines on public pharmacokinetic data, with a documented export/import
    bridge to Phoenix WinNonlin. Demonstrates that NCA engines converge when
    calculation conventions are explicitly matched, and provides a CDISC
    SDTM-to-PP-domain pipeline.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    PKNCA (>= 0.11.0),
    NonCompart (>= 0.6.0),
    ggplot2,
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    pharmaversesdtm,
    dplyr,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr
